# GPS Vehicle Tracking App - Environment Variables

## Aurora PostgreSQL (Auto-configured)
- PGHOST
- PGUSER
- PGDATABASE
- AWS_ROLE_ARN
- AWS_REGION

## NextAuth - Google OAuth
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=<generate: openssl rand -base64 32>
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://tu-dominio.com (o http://localhost:3000 para dev)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<de Google Cloud Console>
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=<de Google Cloud Console>

## Google Maps API
- NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY - Your Google Maps API key for the map visualization

## Optional: Notification Services
- FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID - For push notifications
- FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY - For Firebase
- FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL - For Firebase
- SENDGRID_API_KEY - For email notifications
